# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   1. Contact form email
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# The /api/contact route tries providers in this order:
#   1) Resend (preferred — simple HTTPS API, works on any host)
#   2) Gmail SMTP via nodemailer (fallback)
#
# All submissions go to CONTACT_TO (defaults to vbphotograph2015@gmail.com).
#
# ─── Option A: Resend (recommended for production) ──────────
#
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com (free tier is generous).
# 2. Create an API key → paste below as RESEND_API_KEY.
# 3. Optional: verify your domain (vbphotographe.com) inside Resend,
#    then set RESEND_FROM to a mailbox on that domain, e.g.
#      RESEND_FROM="VB Photographe <hello@vbphotographe.com>"
#    Until the domain is verified, leave RESEND_FROM unset — the
#    route uses Resend's shared onboarding@resend.dev sender.
#
RESEND_API_KEY=
# RESEND_FROM="VB Photographe <hello@vbphotographe.com>"

# ─── Option B: Gmail SMTP (fallback) ────────────────────────
#
# 1. Enable 2FA on the Gmail account (required).
# 2. Generate an app password at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    (choose "Mail" → "Other" → name it "vbphotographe.com").
# 3. Paste the 16-char password below as SMTP_PASS.
#
SMTP_USER=vbphotograph2015@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=

# Optional overrides — defaults shown
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# CONTACT_TO=vbphotograph2015@gmail.com


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   2. Cloudflare R2 — image CDN
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Full setup walkthrough: docs/CLOUDFLARE_SETUP.md
#
# Only NEXT_PUBLIC_CDN_BASE_URL is required for the site to serve
# from R2 — the others are only used by `npm run upload`.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Prefix Next.js prepends to every /assets/... URL.
# Leave blank in dev to serve photos from the local public/assets folder.
# In production (Render/Vercel/etc.), set this to your R2 public URL:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CDN_BASE_URL=https://pub-abcdef123456.r2.dev
# or your custom Cloudflare-fronted domain:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CDN_BASE_URL=https://img.vbphotographe.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_CDN_BASE_URL=

# Only needed for `npm run upload` — the sync script that pushes photos
# from your machine into the bucket.
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=vb-photographe
